=== WEB SOURCE (the specification) ===
  features/system/components/FSMStateDiagram.tsx — a PURE PRESENTATIONAL leaf fed
  `{ fsmType, transitions }` by the FSM debugger page; only data source is useTranslation.
  Composition:
    • useMemo over the transitions: filter to fsmType (unless 'all'); accumulate
      stateCounts (to_state + from_state), edgeCounts (key `from->to`), and latestState
      (to_state of the max `ts`).
    • Guard `if (!states || !edges)` → GlassPanel with the <h2> title "State Diagram"
      (t『fsm.stateDiagram』) + EmptyState message "Select a specific FSM type to view its
      state diagram" (t『fsm.selectFsmType』).
    • Else: a flex-wrap node row — per state a box (status dot · name · count · current
      ring + animate-pulse) and, for all but the last, an arrow carrying the optional
      edge count — followed by an edge-summary list (top-10 edges by count, `from→to ×n`).
  Registry data (web src/types/fsm): 8 FSMs (vehicle, drive_session, charge_session,
  command, notification, alert_cooldown, automation, telemetry_connection) — each an
  ordered state list, deriveEdges(TRANSITIONS), and getStateColor (variant + overrides).

